        "w": 24,
        "h": 3
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "omp splits the tokens and cost of each model request evenly across the tool calls that request asked for. labkit cannot do the same yet: an `agent.tool.run` span does not name the request that asked for it (both are children of the turn), and TraceQL metrics cannot divide one span's value among its siblings. It needs the request's identity, or its tokens and cost divided by its tool calls, on each `agent.tool.run` span."
      },
      "description": "Why omp's attributed tokens and cost per tool are not on this dashboard, and what labkit would need for them."
    },
